    "## Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "`Dataset.load` reads the FIT files (cached in `data/computed`) and rebuilds the features."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "afdcb0f1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'2070 segments, 20 activities'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 2,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "dataset = Dataset.load(min_distance=40, max_distance=100, segment_width=500)\n",
    "dataset.target = \"pace\"  # set before building the model: the result is saved per target\n",
    "\n",
    "config = LassoConfig(\n",
    "    seed=42,\n",
    "    n_splits=5,  # outer folds: RMSE of the selection\n",
    "    inner_n_splits=5,  # inner folds of LassoCV: choice of the penalty\n",
    "    test_size=0.2,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "f\"{len(dataset.data)} segments, {dataset.data[GROUP_COLUMN].nunique()} activities\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cb030599",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Train / test split\n",
